  m_Name: Story_emeka
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: emeka
  title: The Dead Letter Box
  summary: 'Emeka knows everyone''s business and tells nobody. Sterling wants to replace his round with parcel lockers. He keeps a box of letters nobody could deliver, and one is for whoever farms your land. Fork: petition city hall to keep the round, or take Sterling''s logistics job.'
  pathAName: Save the route
  pathBName: Take the tower job
  parts:
  - title: Your first postcard
    number: 1
    heartsNeeded: 1
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Told you everybody gets a postcard in their first weeks. Here. Hand-delivered, because I couldn't wait for tomorrow's round.
    - It's a picture of the plaza. On the back it says 'Welcome to the street. From the street.' Everybody signed it. Gus signed it twice, once to complain about the pen.
    happy: 1
